Italian furniture company.

In 2024 they remade their Catifa 53 chair (2001) as the [[Catifa Carta]]. The seat shell is [[PaperShell]], kraft paper and natural resin pressed from wood-industry leftovers. The metal frame comes apart from it.

Their question was "How can a chair return to nature?" Their answer is [[BioChar]]: at the end the shell is burned without oxygen and the carbon goes into soil.

That only works where there is a plant to do it.
